{"3630150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Front", "steam_appid": 3630150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/efea31969a6a803d305aa4caed9d52ff.avif?t=1787121641\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Last Front — a modern RTS with deep tactical gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Front is inspired by the great real-time strategies of the 90s and 2000s, preserving the spirit of classic RTS while bringing the action into a realistic modern military world. Build bases, develop your economy, command armies, and apply advanced technologies to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At release, you’ll find three main factions, each with its own doctrine of warfare:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RVI (Initiative of the Radical Voice)</strong> — a fictional Middle Eastern organization focused on stealth, ambushes, raids, and mobile strike groups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Russia</strong> — heavy armored vehicles, powerful artillery, and a skillful combination of defense and large-scale counterattacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USA</strong> — high-tech weaponry, precision airstrikes, and reconnaissance superiority.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Add the game to your wishlist to not miss the demo and updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/6e04ae276571094141498ae1a5d8d32e.poster.avif?t=1787121641\" width=376 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/6e04ae276571094141498ae1a5d8d32e.webm?t=1787121641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/6e04ae276571094141498ae1a5d8d32e.mp4?t=1787121641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/b013c00dfbfa362f64e1ac03c2c51ba0.poster.avif?t=1787121641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/b013c00dfbfa362f64e1ac03c2c51ba0.webm?t=1787121641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/b013c00dfbfa362f64e1ac03c2c51ba0.mp4?t=1787121641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/a3b8ec2b1959739017362c125619164d.poster.avif?t=1787121641\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/a3b8ec2b1959739017362c125619164d.webm?t=1787121641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/a3b8ec2b1959739017362c125619164d.mp4?t=1787121641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction is divided into <strong>unique combat commands</strong> — special generals or divisions with their own tactics and exclusive units:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Russia: <strong>Strategic Missile Forces</strong> specializing in long-range missile weaponry and strategic strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the USA: <strong>Air Command</strong>, focusing on fighters, attack aircraft, and helicopters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the RVI: generals armed with unconventional solutions — suicide drones, ambushes, covert movements, and biological weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is only part of the available commands — each faction will have 2–3 different commanders, each unlocking a new set of units and a unique style of warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/0ee36cc48d142e8e19fa6eab96e34031.poster.avif?t=1787121641\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/0ee36cc48d142e8e19fa6eab96e34031.webm?t=1787121641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/0ee36cc48d142e8e19fa6eab96e34031.mp4?t=1787121641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic modern setting</strong> — modern combat vehicles, helicopters, drones, and unique units with authentic weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique factions and playstyles</strong> — choose the style of warfare that suits you, from fast mobile air forces to heavy armored vehicles and defensive structures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent AI and multiple difficulty levels</strong> — from beginner to veteran strategist, everyone will find their challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630150/extras/f833d7f04a082d6bca1e9b625587f26c.poster.avif?t=1787121641\" wid